<StanceStatePage state="nh">
  <p>This webpage houses the responses to 5 questions
    crafted by the New Hampshire Stance on Science team.</p>
    <p>Only official candidates who will appear on ballots were contacted.</p>
    <p>Candidates were contacted in June 2026 (with a follow-up to those who
    did not initially respond) and given the opportunity to answer all questions. Only the responses of candidates who answered the questions are
    included. None of the candidates' responses were modified in any way before
    being published on this resource page.</p>

    <p><u>For the <strong>September 2026 Primary Election and November 2026
    General Election</strong></u>, only candidates in
    the following elections were contacted<sup>1</sup>:</p>

    <div>
      <details class="stance-race-group">
        <summary>US Senate</summary>
          <ul>
            <li>Republican Primary for NH Representative</li>
            <li>Democratic Primary for NH Representative</li>
          </ul>
      </details>
      <details class="stance-race-group">
        <summary>US House of Representatives</summary>
          <ul>
            <li>Republican Party Primary for NH Representative for District 1 & District 2</li>
            <li>Democratic Party Primary for NH Representative for District 1 & District 2</li>
          </ul>
      </details>
      <details class="stance-race-group">
        <summary>New Hampshire Governor</summary>
          <ul>
            <li>Republican Primary</li>
            <li>Democratic Primary</li>
            <li>Independent Primary</li>
          </ul>
      </details>
      <details class="stance-race-group">
        <summary>New Hampshire State Senate</summary>
          <ul>
            <li>Republican Primary for NH State Senate for Districts 1-24</li>
            <li>Democratic Primary for NH State Senate for Districts 1-24</li>
          </ul>
      </details>
      <details class="stance-race-group">
        <summary>New Hampshire House of Representatives</summary>
          <ul>
            <li>Republican Primary for NH House of Representatives for Belknap Districts 1-8, Carroll Districts 1-8, Cheshire District 1-18, Coos Districts 1-7, Grafton Districts 1-18, Hillsborough Districts 1-45, Merrimack Districts 1-30, Rockingham Districts 1-40, Strafford Districts 1-21, Sullivan Districts 1-8</li>
            <li>Democratic Primary for NH House of Representatives for Belknap Districts 1-8, Carroll Districts 1-8, Cheshire District 1-18, Coos Districts 1-7, Grafton Districts 1-18, Hillsborough Districts 1-45, Merrimack Districts 1-30, Rockingham Districts 1-40, Strafford Districts 1-21, Sullivan Districts 1-8</li>
          </ul>
      </details>
    </div>
    <p><small><sup>1</sup> These primary elections were prioritized because
    they have more than one official candidate on the ballot.</small></p>

    <p>The contacted candidates include those running in both the September 2026
    primary election and the November 2026 general election.</p>
</StanceStatePage>
